### [x] 7 — MED: Process.Args missing (RFC-002 named-gap)

`process.oo` facade is live but lacks `process_args(&ProcessCap) -> List[String]`. The C runtime (`chs_rt_sys.c`) has `sys_args` but it's not exported to the language.

**Owns:** Either implement `process_args` in `std/os/process.oo` or formally document it as residual in the inventory.

